-- Activity translations for the 68 in-scope fishing/diving/generic
-- activity entities (all activities except surfing, which is deferred)
-- into all 6 rolled-out languages (de/es/it/ru/ja/zh), powering the new
-- /{locale}/maldives/fishing/[activity]/, /{locale}/maldives/diving/[activity]/
-- and /{locale}/maldives/activities/[activity]/ routes. 32 of the 68
-- entities follow one shared sentence skeleton (varying only the
-- activity-type phrase, duration and provider); the remaining 36 are
-- hand-translated bespoke/family content (Emperor charters, Himmafushi
-- fishing/snorkeling/watersports, Male City tours, Male Atoll excursion
-- family, and 3 standalone entities). short_description and description
-- both equal the translated summary, mirroring ActivityDetail.summary
-- being the single underlying field. body_html is unused for activities
-- (kept empty). Already applied directly against the live DB; this
-- migration keeps a from-scratch replay in sync.
on conflict (entity_id, locale) do update set
  slug = excluded.slug, title = excluded.title, short_description = excluded.short_description, description = excluded.description,
  body_html = excluded.body_html, meta_title = excluded.meta_title, meta_description = excluded.meta_description,
  translation_status = excluded.translation_status, translated_by = excluded.translated_by, updated_at = now();
